WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.911
Week 8: Family, Description, and Possession. describe people and relationships express possession identify a person precisely

2
00:00:08.911 --> 00:00:15.583
Mission brief. Present a real or fictional family network and explain three relationships.

3
00:00:15.583 --> 00:00:25.265
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:25.265 --> 00:00:33.408
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:42.191
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:42.191 --> 00:01:07.297
Model language. Mi hermana mayor es muy amable. — My older sister is very kind. Conozco a los padres de Elena. — I know Elena's parents. Nuestra familia vive en tres ciudades. — Our family lives in three cities. ¿Es suyo este retrato? — Is this portrait yours? Tengo dos hermanos y una prima. — I have two brothers and one female cousin.

7
00:01:07.297 --> 00:01:17.302
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
